A command with two unreferenced functions that one line directive each renders
at the same line. They are two declarations, so each is reported.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//line main.go:20:1
func alpha() {}

//line main.go:20:1
func bravo() {}
